ty</span></a><span>. Please refer to our </span><a href='https://ovitrac.github.io/SFPPy/MigrationModeling/'><span>publications</span></a><span> for details on the limitations of the presented approaches and assumptions.</span></p></blockquote><p>&nbsp;</p><hr /><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 id='🌟-|-3-|--why-sfppy'><strong><span>🌟 | 3 |  Why SFPPy?</span></strong></h2><p><span>✔ </span><strong><code>SFPPy</code><span>:</span></strong><span> is </span><strong><span>free</span></strong><span> and </span><strong><span>opensource</span></strong><span>. </span>
